  "body": "**Suggestion**\nAdd a feature to set reminders on specific messages mimicking the \"Remind me about this\" feature in slack\n\n\nIn slack you can (see https://slack.com/intl/en-gb/help/articles/208423427-Set-a-reminder):\n- In any conversation, hover over a message or file.\n- Click the three dots icon in the top-right corner of the message or file, then select Remind me about this.\n- Choose a time from the list, or select Custom time to pick your own.\n\nThis is a great way to handle messages that are important but not urgent, so that they don't get lost.\n\n\n",
